WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.267 --> 00:00:02.461
The same ball, four ways to start.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.553
On load: it starts as soon as the page shows it.

3
00:00:17.633 --> 00:00:20.037
On hover: it waits for the pointer.

4
00:00:32.767 --> 00:00:36.450
On click: a click starts it, the next one pauses it.

5
00:00:49.167 --> 00:00:53.816
And they all wait until they are half on screen, so this one starts when you scroll to it.

6
00:01:10.567 --> 00:01:16.523
Set the start in the editor, and every player honours it. Or override it here.
